cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Alchemy, please cite the manuscript below. It is being prepared
  for submission; this entry will be updated with the published reference.
title: Alchemy
abstract: >-
  Crystallographic validation of modeled metal sites. Alchemy combines local
  difference density with metal–donor coordination geometry into
  PASS/REVIEW/SUSPECT classifications and a 0–100 score for each site.
type: software
